drive-native (0.1.0~dev20261108.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Merge the #14/#17 uncertain-upload and background-error work: bound
    reconciliation to five attempts with 10/30/120/300 s backoff, let a local
    deletion void an uncertain creation, stop recording permission denials as
    sticky background errors, and clear structured background errors on success
    or recovery.
  * Merge the #15/#16 SQLite hot-spot work behind schema 27: add node indexes
    for operations and namespace_ops plus partial nodes indexes for conflicts,
    pins and cache candidates; rewrite sync_issues as a four-arm UNION; use
    keyset pagination for conflict and issue queries; collect cache candidates
    in one query; and move GetIssues outside the global store lock.
  * Merge the #8 committed status projection: serve GetStates from a read-only
    WAL snapshot maintained from the commit log. On a 210k-node synthetic tree
    the states p95 measured 312.9 ms (SLO 500 ms); a 2000-entry directory
    listed in 4.07 ms from the store and 0.727 ms through FUSE; a 2000 ms held
    store lock delayed GetStates/GetIssues to 310/314 ms. The 48-way mixed
    workload still reported 28 timeouts (SLO 0) because GetOverview computes
    synced-issue and cache counts under the global lock.
  * Merge the #2 desktop work: one manager window for all mounts, tray
    activity, persistent sync history and a notification channel; the backend
    handover check now expects state schema 27.
  * Merge the #5 namespace projection work: bound the NamespaceIndex build
    cost and use a lean projection instead of full scans; paired metadata
    benchmark evidence is in the source archive.
